WHEREAS, W.S. § 15-1-404 outlines the requirements of local governments in
initiating annexation proceedings and requires that a resolution be adopted certifying
compliance with W.S. § 15-1-402; and
WHEREAS, the proposed annexation is compliant with W.S. § 15-1-402. The
proposed annexation meets the following criteria found in W. S. § 15-1-402(a):
(i)
The annexation of the area is for the protection of the health, safety and
welfare of the persons residing in the area and in the city or town;
(ii)
The urban development of the area sought to be annexed would constitute a
natural, geographical, economical and social part of the annexing city or
town;
